WEBVTT

00:03:38.370 --> 00:03:39.770
Not that dream again...

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:47.140
KUJO Jotaro.

00:03:47.350 --> 00:03:48.250
Age seventeen.

00:03:48.580 --> 00:03:50.780
(six-foot four)

00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:53.520
His father is Japanese,
a jazz musician...

00:03:54.190 --> 00:03:56.420
currently on a concert
tour overseas.

00:03:58.430 --> 00:04:00.630
His British-American mother...

00:04:00.630 --> 00:04:03.460
visits every day to try to
persuade him to leave.

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:07.360
Oh, and...

00:04:07.870 --> 00:04:10.960
his cell is filled with
personal items!

00:04:14.210 --> 00:04:18.580
H... Hey! Wait! Save me! Let me out
of here! Move me somewhere else!

00:04:18.810 --> 00:04:20.580
They were just local punks,

00:04:20.850 --> 00:04:24.370
but he sent eight of
them to the hospital.

00:04:24.850 --> 00:04:27.550
Despite that, we've told
him that he's free to go.

00:04:27.790 --> 00:04:29.720
Why won't he leave?

00:04:30.520 --> 00:04:31.860
Staying in a place like this...

00:04:31.860 --> 00:04:33.450
what the hell is he
trying to accomplish?

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:40.730
Help me! Hey! He'll kill me! He's
possessed by a devil! Hey, save me!

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:13.010
<i>Papa! </i>

00:05:13.190 --> 00:05:14.080
<i>It's Holley! </i>

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:16.450
<i>Papa, please help me! </i>

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:18.060
<i>What's wrong, Holley? </i>

00:05:18.760 --> 00:05:19.590
<i>Actually</i>

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:22.990
<i>It's about Jotaro He ran into</i>
<i>some local gangmembers</i>

00:05:23.160 --> 00:05:25.060
<i>got into a fight, and</i>
<i>was thrown in jail! </i>

00:05:26.200 --> 00:05:28.640
<i>The police officer told</i>
<i>me that they'll release him, </i>

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:31.830
<i>and that I should make him stay</i>
<i>home to reflect on what he's done</i>

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:36.280
<i>but he refuses to leave</i>
<i>until he discovers</i>

00:05:36.280 --> 00:05:40.410
<i>the true nature of the</i>
<i>"evil spirit" that haunts him</i>

00:05:42.420 --> 00:05:43.250
<i>Evil spirit? </i>

00:05:44.550 --> 00:05:45.880
<i>Calm down, Holley</i>

00:05:46.590 --> 00:05:49.450
<i>You're certain Jotaro said</i>
<i>something about an evil spirit? </i>

00:05:49.890 --> 00:05:51.820
<i>Eh? I'm sure of it, Papa</i>

00:05:52.190 --> 00:05:54.060
<i>All right Don't worry, Holley</i>

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:56.590
<i>I'll come over right</i>
<i>away to help you</i>

00:05:57.730 --> 00:05:58.630
<i>Thank you</i>

00:05:58.800 --> 00:05:59.560
<i>Papa! </i>

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:06.330
Papa!

00:06:18.150 --> 00:06:20.140
You're going home
for sure today, Kujo!

00:06:23.220 --> 00:06:24.280
Don't worry.

00:06:24.460 --> 00:06:26.520
I'll be taking my
grandson home with me.

00:06:28.230 --> 00:06:29.130
Grandson...?

00:06:33.570 --> 00:06:34.590
Damned woman...

00:06:34.800 --> 00:06:36.790
you even dragged that
old man into this...

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:40.400
What a pain...

00:06:41.310 --> 00:06:42.370
Hey, Jotaro.

00:06:42.810 --> 00:06:45.680
How dare you talk to
your own mother that way!

00:06:46.310 --> 00:06:47.110
Moreover...

00:06:47.110 --> 00:06:48.750
is that the attitude you have
towards your own grandfather,

00:06:48.750 --> 00:06:51.490
after I've come all the way from New
York for the first time in ten years?

00:06:51.490 --> 00:06:52.210
Is it?

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:08.760
Come on out.

00:07:09.140 --> 00:07:10.660
You're going home with me.

00:07:10.840 --> 00:07:11.960
I never asked you to come here.

00:07:12.070 --> 00:07:13.330
Get lost.

00:07:14.270 --> 00:07:15.040
Jotaro!

00:07:15.810 --> 00:07:17.140
Your grandfather... l'm sure...

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:19.210
he can help you.

00:07:20.550 --> 00:07:22.540
He can help me, huh?

00:07:24.650 --> 00:07:27.280
You don't understand the terrible
nature of this evil spirit, do you?

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:37.760
W-when did he...?

00:07:59.690 --> 00:08:01.420
JOTARO!

00:08:28.820 --> 00:08:36.090
H-hurry! Let me out of here now! Save
me! Why did the bullet stop in midair!?

00:08:36.190 --> 00:08:37.120
Papa...

00:08:37.390 --> 00:08:41.090
Another hand came out of
Jotaro and stopped the bullet...

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:44.860
You can see it too, Holley?

00:08:45.770 --> 00:08:46.560
Y-yes...

00:08:47.100 --> 00:08:48.620
Are you experiencing
any strange sensations?

00:08:49.570 --> 00:08:51.000
N-no, not really...

00:08:53.410 --> 00:08:54.300
I see.

00:08:58.550 --> 00:09:01.710
Well, we'll be just outside, waiting.
We'll leave this matter to you.

00:09:03.150 --> 00:09:04.050
That hand...

00:09:04.320 --> 00:09:06.340
is invisible to everyone else...?

00:09:07.120 --> 00:09:09.090
I'll explain later, Holley.

00:09:09.560 --> 00:09:12.350
In any case, we still have
to get Jotaro out of his cell.

00:09:12.830 --> 00:09:14.380
Don't you get it, old man?

00:09:15.160 --> 00:09:16.890
Don't try to get me out of here!

00:09:17.730 --> 00:09:18.760
Just take this...

00:09:19.070 --> 00:09:20.500
and go on home!

00:09:24.600 --> 00:09:25.900
W-what the...?

00:09:27.210 --> 00:09:28.540
<i>My artificial hand! </i>

00:09:34.450 --> 00:09:35.350
<i>Incredible</i>

00:09:35.720 --> 00:09:37.770
<i>He managed to</i>
<i>make a fool out of ME</i>

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:40.810
<i>To be honest, his abilities are</i>
<i>greater than I ever imagined</i>

00:09:41.720 --> 00:09:42.480
<i>However</i>

00:09:42.760 --> 00:09:45.730
<i>I don't think he'll be</i>
<i>convinced by my words alone</i>

00:09:46.760 --> 00:09:49.760
<i>No, to force him to prepare</i>
<i>for the danger he must face, </i>

00:09:49.760 --> 00:09:52.930
<i>Jotaro must be made to</i>
<i>understand physically</i>

00:09:57.240 --> 00:09:58.430
It's your turn!

00:09:59.710 --> 00:10:03.510
Three years ago in Egypt,
I met my friend, Avdol.

00:10:08.320 --> 00:10:09.110
Avdol...

00:10:09.550 --> 00:10:12.250
Make my grandson, Jotaro,
come out of this cage!

00:10:13.290 --> 00:10:14.220
Mr. Joestar...

00:10:14.790 --> 00:10:16.650
I may have to be
rough with him...

00:10:18.260 --> 00:10:19.090
I don't care.

00:10:19.530 --> 00:10:20.650
I'll leave it up to you!

00:10:21.130 --> 00:10:21.990
Don't try it.

00:10:22.360 --> 00:10:24.520
You may be strong, but
there's no way you can win.

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:30.270
Papa! What's he...?

00:11:00.730 --> 00:11:01.390
This is...

00:11:07.370 --> 00:11:08.170
Yes...

00:11:08.540 --> 00:11:10.210
What you refer to
as an "evil spirit,"

00:11:10.210 --> 00:11:12.010
Avdol possesses as well.

00:11:21.620 --> 00:11:24.150
Avdol's will controls
this evil spirit!

00:11:24.520 --> 00:11:25.350
Its name is...

00:11:25.790 --> 00:11:27.230
Magician's Red!

00:11:28.860 --> 00:11:31.350
An evil spirit
controlled by will?

00:11:32.030 --> 00:11:32.930
That's right.

00:11:33.070 --> 00:11:34.970
The evil spirit
can be controlled.

00:12:02.360 --> 00:12:04.520
So it has finally
shown itself...

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:19.180
I didn't expect him to
materialize it so well...

00:12:29.190 --> 00:12:30.490
Mr. Joestar...

00:12:30.960 --> 00:12:33.050
I thought I could
take it easy on him...

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:35.590
But his power is
greater than I imagined.

00:12:36.100 --> 00:12:38.390
There's a chance that
my life is at risk...

00:12:40.600 --> 00:12:44.000
If you insist on having me force
your grandson out of there...

00:12:44.340 --> 00:12:46.600
he may end up in the hospital.

00:12:46.810 --> 00:12:47.700
I don't care.

00:12:50.680 --> 00:12:52.080
Red Bind!

00:12:59.320 --> 00:12:59.940
Papa!

00:13:00.150 --> 00:13:02.350
Jotaro is...!

00:13:06.830 --> 00:13:09.690
What the hell is happening!?

00:13:10.060 --> 00:13:11.220
Eh? It's hot...!

00:13:11.400 --> 00:13:13.660
What's going on in there?

00:13:19.510 --> 00:13:21.030
Can't... breathe...

00:13:23.140 --> 00:13:24.470
If you weaken...

00:13:24.910 --> 00:13:26.440
the evil spirit within
you weakens as well.

00:13:27.210 --> 00:13:28.080
Jotaro...

00:13:28.720 --> 00:13:31.650
The true nature of what
you think is an evil spirit...

00:13:32.850 --> 00:13:36.620
is a vision of the power
of your life energy.

00:13:36.990 --> 00:13:40.260
It appears and stands by your
side! We call this manifestation...

00:13:40.990 --> 00:13:42.090
a "STAND!"

00:13:43.360 --> 00:13:44.260
How do you like that?

00:13:44.460 --> 00:13:47.190
Do you want to come
out of that cage now?

00:13:47.930 --> 00:13:49.400
Enough already...

00:13:49.900 --> 00:13:51.960
Keep this up, and you'll pay...

00:13:52.270 --> 00:13:53.200
with your life!

00:14:12.960 --> 00:14:13.980
Th... the iron bars...!

00:14:14.090 --> 00:14:16.820
Th... th... they're bending
by themselves!

00:14:43.220 --> 00:14:45.320
Why did you turn your
back on me all of a sudden?

00:14:50.330 --> 00:14:51.590
Mr. Joestar...

00:14:52.230 --> 00:14:56.170
As you can see, he is
out of the cage now.

00:15:16.360 --> 00:15:18.420
Guess I've been outwitted...

00:15:18.830 --> 00:15:20.020
Not exactly.

00:15:20.590 --> 00:15:24.220
My intention was to
put you in the hospital.

00:15:24.830 --> 00:15:25.420
However...

00:15:25.770 --> 00:15:29.060
your Stand exhibited much
greater power than I expected.

00:15:30.770 --> 00:15:31.670
What if...

00:15:33.410 --> 00:15:35.140
my so-called Stand...

00:15:35.140 --> 00:15:37.800
had thrown this
iron bar at you?

00:15:37.910 --> 00:15:39.400
What would you
have done then?

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:42.220
An iron bar like that...

00:15:42.220 --> 00:15:45.450
my Magician's Red would
have vaporized it in midair.

00:15:46.120 --> 00:15:47.480
It's that simple.

00:15:48.720 --> 00:15:49.520
Jotaro...

00:15:49.890 --> 00:15:53.760
Your Stand is a special power that
has awakened because you'll need it.

00:15:54.260 --> 00:15:55.660
I'll explain it all to you later.

00:15:56.360 --> 00:15:57.060
Now...

00:15:57.200 --> 00:15:58.130
let's go home.

00:16:45.990 --> 00:16:46.760
Listen...

00:16:47.260 --> 00:16:47.960
Jotaro.

00:16:50.330 --> 00:16:55.100
This is the story of the destiny
bestowed upon the Joestar family...

00:16:59.840 --> 00:17:01.540
Four years ago...

00:17:03.610 --> 00:17:06.100
in the Atlantic Ocean,
off the coast of Africa...

00:17:13.390 --> 00:17:16.260
a sturdy iron casket was salvaged
from a shipwreck on the ocean floor.

00:17:18.260 --> 00:17:20.450
Well... my grandfather...

00:17:21.160 --> 00:17:25.330
Jonathan Joestar, died on
that sunken passenger ship...

00:17:25.770 --> 00:17:27.860
That much has been confirmed.

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:34.910
However...

00:17:38.910 --> 00:17:40.240
when it was found...

00:17:40.980 --> 00:17:42.710
it was empty.

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:47.410
But...

00:17:47.820 --> 00:17:49.050
I am certain...

00:17:49.490 --> 00:17:53.360
that it once contained the body of the
man that Avdol and I are still pursuing.

00:17:53.960 --> 00:17:54.660
Hold on!

00:17:56.660 --> 00:17:57.650
A hundred years...

00:17:58.070 --> 00:18:01.040
You're telling me that you're going after
a man who was underwater that long?

00:18:01.900 --> 00:18:05.770
You talk as if you believe
that man is still alive!

00:18:06.670 --> 00:18:07.400
Yes.

00:18:07.810 --> 00:18:10.510
I believe that man, who should be
called the very incarnation of evil...

00:18:10.810 --> 00:18:12.370
is still alive!

00:18:13.380 --> 00:18:15.580
He has awoken from
his hundred-year sleep.

00:18:15.920 --> 00:18:16.650
His name is...

00:18:16.650 --> 00:18:17.280
DIO!

00:18:18.920 --> 00:18:21.580
We must do battle against this man!

00:18:21.860 --> 00:18:23.020
It is our destiny!

00:18:37.610 --> 00:18:38.200
Holley...

00:18:38.670 --> 00:18:39.730
Did you get what I asked for?

00:18:40.880 --> 00:18:41.670
Yes!

00:18:43.040 --> 00:18:45.040
But... what are you going
to do with it, Papa?

00:18:45.780 --> 00:18:46.470
Actually...

00:18:46.610 --> 00:18:48.410
about a year ago...

00:18:48.580 --> 00:18:50.850
a Stand ability developed
inside me as well!

00:18:51.650 --> 00:18:52.810
What's that...?

00:18:56.930 --> 00:18:58.390
My Stand is...

00:19:03.870 --> 00:19:04.920
THIS!

00:19:08.340 --> 00:19:09.060
Did you see?

00:19:09.600 --> 00:19:10.900
Those brambles that
came from my hand...

00:19:11.270 --> 00:19:13.900
That is my Stand,
Hermit Purple!

00:19:14.180 --> 00:19:16.970
Its ability is to transfer visions from
a great distance away onto film...

00:19:17.650 --> 00:19:18.540
Psychography!

00:19:19.010 --> 00:19:23.680
The image that is about to appear on
that film will determine your destiny!

00:19:28.960 --> 00:19:29.580
Holley...

00:19:30.190 --> 00:19:32.560
Let us see the nape of
your neck, the left side.

00:19:33.060 --> 00:19:33.760
Jotaro...

00:19:34.260 --> 00:19:35.160
You too.

00:19:41.840 --> 00:19:43.570
That star-shaped birthmark...

00:19:44.340 --> 00:19:48.610
is the star of destiny, which the
Joestar family cannot escape!

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:55.340
According to my mother...

00:19:55.720 --> 00:19:59.550
my father, who died when I was still
a child, had that same birthmark.

00:19:59.850 --> 00:20:02.790
What does this birthmark have to do
with that psychography of yours?

00:20:04.290 --> 00:20:05.760
Well, it's about time...

00:20:19.810 --> 00:20:21.170
That man is Dio!

00:20:21.710 --> 00:20:23.510
He's the only one who
ever appears on the film!

00:20:23.780 --> 00:20:26.410
And look at the birthmark
on the nape of his neck...

00:20:26.850 --> 00:20:29.540
it indicates that the bastard's
body, from the neck down, is...

00:20:29.780 --> 00:20:30.910
my grandfather...

00:20:32.520 --> 00:20:36.620
Jonathan Joestar's body,
which Dio has taken over!

00:21:05.090 --> 00:21:06.110
Again...

00:21:07.590 --> 00:21:12.250
Once again... I sensed that
someone was watching me.

00:21:14.730 --> 00:21:16.920
Could it be
Jonathan's decendants?

00:21:17.970 --> 00:21:24.270
Is this body sending some signals
to its decendants, I wonder?

00:21:51.030 --> 00:21:52.060
That man...

00:21:52.530 --> 00:21:54.570
at this very moment, he's hiding
somewhere in the world...

00:21:54.570 --> 00:21:56.160
and searching for something.

00:22:05.350 --> 00:22:07.210
It's been four years since
he's awoken from his sleep.

00:22:08.180 --> 00:22:10.150
The fact that my
and Jotaro's Stands...

00:22:10.250 --> 00:22:15.280
both appeared within one year
probably has something to do with Dio.

00:22:16.560 --> 00:22:18.080
Our abilities...

00:22:18.590 --> 00:22:21.120
are what the world
refers to as E.S.P.

00:22:21.860 --> 00:22:23.990
I was born with this ability.

00:22:24.600 --> 00:22:27.360
But your Stands are
linked to Dio's body...

00:22:27.800 --> 00:22:31.700
In other words, linked to Jonathan's
body, by invisible threads.

00:22:32.540 --> 00:22:34.340
Probably, Dio's awakening...

00:22:34.740 --> 00:22:38.340
brought forth your
latent powers.

00:22:39.850 --> 00:22:40.470
Avdol...

00:22:40.620 --> 00:22:44.480
From this photograph, can
you tell where Dio is now?

00:22:48.720 --> 00:22:49.750
I can't tell.

00:22:50.390 --> 00:22:51.620
As before...

00:22:51.860 --> 00:22:53.590
the background
shows only darkness.

00:22:53.900 --> 00:22:55.890
If only I could find the
location of that darkness...

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:00.760
Hold on!

00:23:18.450 --> 00:23:19.980
It seems to have
found something.

00:23:37.910 --> 00:23:38.560
A fly...

00:23:38.970 --> 00:23:40.270
W... what?

00:23:40.680 --> 00:23:42.700
There's a fly in
that darkness?

00:23:48.420 --> 00:23:49.310
In any case...

00:23:49.680 --> 00:23:52.210
we need to send this to the
Speedwagon Foundation...

00:23:52.550 --> 00:23:54.280
so they can investigate this fly.

00:23:55.020 --> 00:23:55.850
Mr. Joestar...

00:23:56.020 --> 00:24:00.080
This may help us narrow down the
number of places where Dio could be.

00:24:07.800 --> 00:24:08.460
Holley...

00:24:08.700 --> 00:24:10.600
Please fax this right away.

00:24:11.010 --> 00:24:12.500
Yes, I will.

00:24:36.430 --> 00:24:38.060
The Hermit card.

00:24:38.530 --> 00:24:41.300
Wisdom, wariness, esotericism...

00:24:42.240 --> 00:24:44.070
The Magician card.

00:24:44.470 --> 00:24:46.600
The questioner, diplomacy...

00:24:48.040 --> 00:24:49.410
And...

00:24:50.410 --> 00:24:51.900
the key is...

00:24:52.080 --> 00:24:53.310
this one.

00:24:54.550 --> 00:24:55.850
The Star card.

00:24:56.850 --> 00:24:57.820
Hope...

00:24:59.390 --> 00:25:00.750
Jotaro...
